  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abasajja ba Efulayimu ne babuuza Gidyoni nti, \"Lwaki watuyisa bw'otyo, n'ototuyita bwe wagenda okulwana ne Midiyaani?\" Ne bamunenya nnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye n'abaddamu nti, \"Kiki kye nkoze okugeraageranya nammwe kye mukoze? Amakungula ga Efulayimu tegasinga ezabbibu Abiyezeeri z'akungudde?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yagabula Olebu ne Zeebu abakulembeze ba Midiyaani mu mukono gwammwe. Kiki kye nandiyinzizza okukola okugeraageranya nammwe?\" Awo bwe yabagamba ebigambo ebyo ne bakkakkana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Gidyoni n'abasajja be ebikumi bisatu, nga bakooye, naye nga bakyabawondera, ne batuuka ku Yoludaani ne basomoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'agamba abasajja ab'omu Sukkosi nti, \"Muwe ku basajja bange, ekyokulya, bakooye. Mpondera Zeba ne Zalumunna bakabaka ba Midiyaani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abakungu ab'omu Sukkosi ne bamuddamu nti, \"Eggye lyo limaze okuwamba Zeba ne Zalumunna tulyoke tubawe emmere?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Gidyoni n'abaddamu nti, \"Kale olw'ekyo kye muŋŋambye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda bw'aligabula Zeba ne Zalumunna mu mukono gwange, ndiyuza emibiri gyammwe n'amaggwa ag'omu ddungu n'emyeramannyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yava eyo, n'ayambuka n'alaga e Penieri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", n'abasaba ekintu kye kimu. Naye abantu b'e Penieri ne bamuddamu ng'abasajja ab'omu Sukkosi bwe bamuddamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyeyava agamba abantu b'e Penieri nti, \"Bwe ndikomawo emirembe, ndimenyaamenya omunaala guno.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeba ne Zalumunna baali mu Kalukoli n'eggye lyabwe ery'abasajja ng'omutwalo gumu n'ekitundu, nga be bantu abaasigalawo ku ggye lyonna ery'abantu ab'obuvanjuba. Abasajja ng'emitwalo kkumi n'ebiri abaasowolanga ebitala be baali bafudde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Gidyoni n'ayambukira mu kkubo ly'abo ababeera mu weema ku luuyi olw'ebuvanjuba olw'e Noba n'e Yogubeka n'alumba eggye nga teritegedde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeba ne Zalumunna ne badduka, naye n'abawondera, era n'awamba bakabaka bombi aba Midiyaani, n'awangulira ddala eggye lyabwe lyonna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Gidyoni mutabani wa Yowaasi n'akomawo okuva mu lutalo ng'ayitira mu Lukuubo lwa Keresi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'asangiriza omuvubuka ow'oku bantu ab'omu Sukkosi, n'abaako by'amubuuza. Omuvubuka n'amuwandiikira amannya g'abakungu ab'omu Sukkosi, abakadde nsanvu mu musanvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidyoni n'alyoka ajja eri abasajja ab'omu Sukkosi n'abagamba nti, \"Zeba ne Zalumunna baabo be mwasinzirako okundulira nga muŋŋamba nti, temuyinza kuwa basajja bange abaali bakooye mmere, nga sirina Zeba ne Zalumunna mu mukono gwange.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'akwata abakadde b'ekibuga n'addira amaggwa ag'omu ddungu n'emyeramannyo n'abonereza abasajja ab'omu Sukkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'agenda n'e Penieri n'amenyaamenya omunaala gwa Penieri, n'atta n'abasajja b'omu kibuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'alyoka abuuza Zeba ne Zalumunna nti, \"Abasajja be mwattira e Taboli baali bafaanana batya?\" Ne bamuddamu nti, \"ggwe nga bw'oli nabo bwe baali. Buli omu yali afaanana abalangira.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abaddamu nti, \"Abo baali baganda bange, abaana ba mmange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.8.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda nga bw'ali omulamu, singa mwabalekawo, sandi basse mmwe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo n'agamba Yeseri mutabani we omubereberye nti, \"Golokoka obatte.\" Naye omuvubuka oyo n'atasowolayo kitala kye okubatta. Yatya kubanga yali akyali mulenzi bulenzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeba ne Zalumunna ne boogera nti, \"Ggwe jjangu otutte, kubanga ng'omusajja bw'ali, n'amaanyi ge bwe genkana. Gidyoni n'agolokoka n'atta Zeba ne Zalumunna, n'atwala n'ebyali bitimbiddwa mu bulago bw'eŋŋamira zaabwe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abantu ba Isirayiri ne bagamba Gidyoni nti, \"Tufugire ddala ggwe ne mutabani wo, kubanga otulokodde okuva mu mukono gwa Midiyaani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Gidyoni n'abaddamu nti, \"Nze sijja kubafuga, so ne mutabani wange tajja kubafuga, wabula",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.8.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "y'anaabafuganga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidyoni n'abagamba nti, \"Mbasaba ekintu kimu; buli omu ku mmwe ampe empeta ze yanyaga ku Bayisimayiri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamuddamu nti, \"Okuzikuwa tujja kuzikuwa.\" Ne bayalirira olugoye wansi, buli omu n'ateekako empeta ze yanyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuzito bw'empeta eza zaabu ne buba sekeri lukumi mu lusanvu (nga kilo kkumi na mwenda n'ekitundu), obutabalirako bya kwewoomya, ebirengejja, n'ebyambalo ebya ffulungu, ebyayambalwanga bakabaka ba Midiyaani, n'emikuufu egyateekebwanga mu bulago bw'eŋŋamira zaabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Gidyoni n'addira zaabu n'amusaanuusa n'amukolamu ekifaananyi eky'ekkanzu (efodi), n'akiteeka mu kibuga kye Ofula. Abayisirayiri bonna ne bakivuunamiranga ne bakisinzanga, era ne kifuukira Gidyoni n'enju ye yonna omutego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Midiyaani n'ewangulwa abaana ba Isirayiri, era n'etaddayo kubalumba. Ensi n'eba n'emirembe okumala emyaka amakumi ana, Gidyoni gye yabalamula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerubbaali ye Gidyoni mutabani wa Yowaasi, n'addayo ewaabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidyoni yazaala abaana aboobulenzi nsanvu mu bakazi abangi be yalina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'omuzaana we ow'omu Sekemu yamuzaalira omwana wabulenzi, era n'amutuuma Abimereki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Gidyoni mutabani wa Yowaasi n'afa, ng'akaddiye bulungi, n'aziikibwa mu ntaana ya kitaawe Yowaasi mu Ofula eky'Ababiezeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidyoni nga y'akafa, abaana ba Isirayiri ne bakyuka okusinza babaali ne bafuula Baaluberisi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "katonda waabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Isirayiri ne batajjukira",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.8.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.8.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda waabwe eyabalokola okuva mu mukono gw'abalabe baabwe bonna ku njuyi zonna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne batalaga kusiima eri ab'enju ya Yerubbaali, ye Gidyoni, olw'ebirungi byonna bye yakolera Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
